OL,3,AMiliband says UK had to 'call out'
OL,4,AIsraeli settlements in West Bank before
OL,5,Ait was too late
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Tuesday, Miliband told Parliament
OL,8,Fthe UK would ban the import of goods
OL,9,Ffrom Israeli settlements in the
OL,10,Fillegally occupied West Bank
OL,12,FMiliband also said "settler terrorists"
OL,13,Fwere carrying out "ethnic cleansing" -
OL,14,Faccusing the Israeli government of
OL,15,Fturning a "blind eye"
OL,17,FWithin hours, Israel responded with
OL,18,Ffour "counter-measures" against the UK
OL,19,F- including the closure of the UK
OL,20,Fconsulate in Jerusalem, which is
OL,21,Fexpected to shut in the next 30 days
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
